n runs itself. Automate key resources like Population, Food, and Knowledge to keep things growing\u2014even when you're not actively playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decorations:</strong> Bring your town to life by placing decorations wherever you like. No more empty void\u2014make it uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Satellites:</strong> Play word-guessing mini-games! Type the correct words to earn bursts of valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Areas:</strong> Unlock towns across different themes and eras! The demo includes 2 unique areas, while the full version unlocks all 5.\u201d</p>","developers":["Deskteam"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848210/af73a9d7cbc21acf09e8e39f329bdba25efba8a9/header.jpg?t=1751505497","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257163033,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163033/movie480.mp4?t=1751505495","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163033/movie_max.mp4?t=1751505495"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257163033/bc2b50427b20502994e4d53e524e6320f2b684ab/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751505495","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163033/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751505495","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163033/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751505495"}}],"name":"Desktown","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 11th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1135G7 @ 2.40GHz (8 CPUs), ~2.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphi